own, 27h window)\n\next4 audio-only rows (ch2>=20, ch0=0, bytes>100k): 09-19 23:20Z, 09-20\n07:10-07:15Z, 17:25Z, 17:50Z, 18:55-18:57Z...[+1927 chars]
